<Page title="Privacy">
  <h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
  <p>This site doesn't use cookies and doesn't collect anything you type. There are no analytics right now; if I add basic visit analytics, this page will say what's collected first.</p>

  <h2>On your device</h2>
  <p>If you use the Lights toggle, your choice is saved in your browser's local storage so the site remembers it. It never leaves your device, and clearing site data resets it.</p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which processes requests, including IP addresses, to serve and protect it. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>Images from other sites</h2>
  <p>Some covers and artwork load directly from their sources: Letterboxd, BoardGameGeek, Hardcover, RetroAchievements and the Cover Art Archive. Those services see the request when your browser fetches the image. No referrer is sent.</p>

  <h2 id="takedowns">Takedown requests</h2>
  <p>Some book cover images come from the Hardcover API; rights remain with their respective owners. To request removal, email <a href="mailto:azhar@hey.com">azhar@hey.com</a> with the work, the exact URL on this site, your contact details, and a statement that you have a good-faith belief the use is unauthorized and that you own the rights or are authorized to act for the owner. I'll review requests and remove or disable access to material where appropriate.</p>
</Page>
